  "body": "DOUBLE WESTLAKE ZONING\r\n\r\nWith summer just around the corner, now is the perfect time to secure your place in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 14/82 East Coast Road, where modern, low-maintenance living meets the unbeatable lifestyle Milford is known for. Beautiful beaches, vibrant cafés, boutique shopping and excellent schooling are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nDesigned for comfort and convenience, this stylish home offers light-filled open-plan living, a contemporary kitchen and seamless flow to a private outdoor area. Whether you're entertaining friends, enjoying a quiet morning coffee or returning from an afternoon at the beach, this is easy living at its best.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n- Two generous double bedrooms\r\n- Modern kitchen with quality finishes\r\n- Light-filled open-plan living and dining\r\n- Private outdoor space for entertaining\r\n- Contemporary bathroom\r\n- Dedicated off-street parking\r\n- Freehold, low-maintenance ownership\r\n- Ideal first home, investment or lock-up-and-leave\r\n\r\nLocation Is Everything\r\n\r\nEnjoy morning walks along Milford Beach, refreshing swims on warm summer days and picturesque coastal walks towards Castor Bay and Takapuna.\r\n\r\nMilford Shopping Centre, supermarkets, boutique stores and an excellent selection of cafés and restaurants are all nearby, putting everyday convenience at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate access to sought-after schooling, including Campbells Bay School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Wairau Intermediate and Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools, while easy motorway access makes commuting simple.\r\n\r\nPerfect for first-home buyers, downsizers and investors alike, this is your chance to secure an easy-care home in a location that continues to be highly sought after.\r\n\r\nMake your move before summer arrives.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nSet Date of Sale | 4:00PM, Monday 30th November 2026 (unless sold prior)",
